				{
					"id": 730690402,
					"content": "#喔！那菈{NICKNAME}和派蒙，{F#妳}{M#你}們好呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭羅摩"
				},
				{
					"id": 730690403,
					"content": "嗯。他是蘭耶娑，也是採歌人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭羅摩"
				},
				{
					"id": 730690404,
					"content": "蘭耶娑你好！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730690405,
					"content": "你好！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690406
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730690406,
					"content": "#「接下來唱的是…一位{M#小姐}{F#少年}，追尋至珍之物的詩。在旅途開始時，{M#她}{F#他}雙眸的顏色是沒有一絲陰霾的琥珀…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭耶娑"
				},
				{
					"id": 730690407,
					"content": "…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690408,
						730690409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730690408,
					"content": "感覺怪怪的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690410
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730690410,
					"content": "蘭耶娑他是採歌的蘭那羅裡膽子最大的，所以會經常學到那菈的歌。所以，說話比較特別。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭羅摩"
				},
				{
					"id": 730690411,
					"content": "「我們的宿命，是一同誕生的珍珠…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690412,
						730690413
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭耶娑"
				},
				{
					"id": 730690412,
					"content": "完全沒辦法交流…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690416
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730690416,
					"content": "言歸正傳…既然蘭耶娑是採歌者的話，這附近也有覺樹之堂嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690417
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730690417,
					"content": "蘭拉吉在這裡留下了最後的歌。這樣的話，附近應該就有莎蘭樹！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690418
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭羅摩"
				},
				{
					"id": 730690418,
					"content": "#既然如此，那我們也幫忙吧，{NICKNAME}！趕緊拿到恆素果！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690419
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730690419,
					"content": "「啊啊，這份思念，會結出像石榴一樣血紅的果實。即使命運將你的雙眼蒙上…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690420,
						730690421
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭耶娑"
				},
				{
					"id": 730690420,
					"content": "為了幫助拉娜…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690425
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730690425,
					"content": "#和之前一樣，在玫瑰當中，隱藏著歌曲。既然是那菈{NICKNAME}和派蒙，一定能順利找到！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690426,
						730690428
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭羅摩"
				},
				{
					"id": 730690426,
					"content": "交給我吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690427
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730690427,
					"content": "嗯！交給你了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730690428,
					"content": "「我會點亮你的詩。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690429
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730690429,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730690421,
					"content": "「也無法奪走唇邊的歌…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690422
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730690422,
					"content": "#噫——{NICKNAME}，{F#妳}{M#你}在幹什麼啦！好奇怪喔！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690423
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730690423,
					"content": "#那菈{NICKNAME}應該和蘭耶娑很合得來呢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690424
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭羅摩"
				},
				{
					"id": 730690424,
					"content": "#不要鼓勵{M#他}{F#她}啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690425
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730690413,
					"content": "「啊啊，那罪惡般甜蜜的宿命。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690414
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730690414,
					"content": "#噫——{NICKNAME}，快停下！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690415
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730690415,
					"content": "#那菈{NICKNAME}好厲害！完全聽不懂！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690416
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭羅摩"
				},
				{
					"id": 730690409,
					"content": "是吟遊詩人？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730690410
					]
				}
			]
		},
